Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Kòfrefò nouvo: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault chifre: message kle: key.
>> decrypted := vault dechifre: encrypted kle: key.

Sòti 
ekri: ['Message:'], nouvo-liy
ekri: message, nouvo-liy
ekri: ['Decrypted:'], nouvo-liy
ekri: decrypted, nouvo-liy.
